{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Ouch, My Back!"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "At the Bowling Alley"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "exercise regime"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a routine of physical activity to keep you fit and healthy "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've started an exercise regime."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob01aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about free time activities."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "personal trainer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who helps you develop a proper  exercise regime "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've been working out with a personal trainer for a couple of weeks."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob01aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to beat"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to win a game against someone in a competition"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Let's see if I can beat you at this game."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob01aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bowling"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the sport of throwing a large, heavy ball down a lane to knock over pins "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I haven't been bowling in years."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob01aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "relationship "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a personal connection to someone "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've been talking a lot about our relationship."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob01aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to tone up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to strengthen your muscles "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can see you've toned up a little."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le03ob01aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Present Perfect Continuous vs Present Perfect"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a past action or an action that began in the past that is connected to the present in some way. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use Present Perfect Continuous tense to describe: <ul> \t<li> a single activity that lasts a long time, and </li> <li> an action that is repeated over a long period of time.</li></ul> These continue up to the present."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the Present Perfect tense to talk about experience. <br/>When you use the Present Perfect tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: <br/>  <span class=\"italic\"> I have learned English </span> = <span class=\"italic\"> I learned English in the past and now I can speak English.</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\"> He has bought a painting </span> =  <span class=\"italic\"> He bought the painting in the past and now he has a painting.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the Present Perfect Continuous tense when a long activity has just stopped.<br/> <br/> To emphasize the action, use the continuous form.<ul><span class=\"italic\"> <li> We've been working really hard for a couple of months.</li></span> <span class=\"italic\"> <li> She's been having a hard time. </li></span></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To emphasize the result of the action, use the simple form.<ul><span class=\"italic\"> <li> I've made fifteen phone calls this morning.</li></span><span class=\"italic\"> <li> He's written a very good report.</li></span></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"verb +ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talking on the phone <span class=\\\"strong\\\">for</span> an hour.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"working there <span class=\\\"strong\\\">since</span> 2010.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": " <ul><li> You use FOR to talk about how long an action has been happening (a week, 2 days, five hours, six years etc.)</li> \t<li>You use SINCE to talk about when the action started (2010, Monday, she was a child)</li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I've been training with a personal trainer for two weeks."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I haven't had any free time since I started there."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le03ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Social Activities"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about a social activities, you often use the gerund form of a verb. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The gerund form is the noun form of a verb.<br/>  You form the gerund by adding <span class=\"strong\">ing</span> to the end of a verb. <br/> Gerunds are often used to talk about activities. <br/> <br/> Social activities are things you do with other people."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Gerund\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"garden\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gardening\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I enjoy gardening on the weekends.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bowl\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bowling\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have never been bowling.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"swim\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"swimming\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I've been swimming every day for ten years.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"watch\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"watching\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I like watching TV.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cook\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cooking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm taking cooking classes.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Interview a partner about their free time activities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find about about wha